eem documented in cases where some columns have `ratio` set and some don't (?), but it _seems_ like something sensible happens, at least when there are no `Rule`s involved, i.e.:\r\n      + If `expand=True`, columns with no `ratio` take up as little space as possible. Seems optimal. ✅\r\n      + If `expand=False`, the `ratio`s ma\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
